Tech stack:
- Astro
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Keystatic
- Cloudflare Pages

Principles:
- Static-first.
- Minimize JavaScript.
- Accessibility WCAG 2.1 AA.
- Mobile-first responsive design.
- SEO optimized.
- Reusable components.
- No unnecessary dependencies.

Code quality:
- Strict TypeScript.
- ESLint clean.
- Prettier formatting.

Performance targets:
- Lighthouse score > 95.
- Total JS < 100 KB where practical.

Content:
- All editable content must be managed through Keystatic.

Branch strategy:
- develop = dev
- qa = staging
- main = production